### Semantic palette

These values preserve the palette supplied for this page. They are an example foundation release, not a claim that every possible foreground/background pairing has passed contrast review.

| Semantic role | Token | Light | Dark |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Primary action | `color.primary.base` | `#007a3d` | `#22c55e` |
| Text on primary | `color.primary.content` | `#ffffff` | `#09130e` |
| App background | `color.surface.background` | `#f4f8f5` | `#09130e` |
| Card surface | `color.surface.card` | `#ffffff` | `#0d1912` |
| Subtle border | `color.border.subtle` | `#d4e2d8` | `#193828` |
